{
  "description": "将已授权的课件文档导出为离线单 HTML、在线单 HTML 或网页包，返回生成与写盘的真实状态。Project V10 使用同一 Published V3 输出。同任务同文档的既有导出未被修改时可原位更新；其他同名文件不覆盖，不需先删除旧文件。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "destination": {
        "maxLength": 1024,
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "format": {
        "enum": [
          "html-offline",
          "html-online",
          "web-package"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "target": {
        "maxLength": 200,
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "target",
      "format"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
    "group": "edit",
    "label": "导出文档",
    "targetKinds": [
      "document"
    ]
  },
  "name": "document.export",
  "version": 1
}
